      "releaseNotes": "Correlate 2.7 connects to your Oura account, so your Oura scores arrive on their own — no more CSV exports.\n\nNEW\n• Connect Oura. In Data Sources, connect your Oura account once and Correlate syncs a year of readiness, sleep and activity scores, temperature deviation, nightly HRV and daily stress, then keeps them up to date when you open the app. Requires an active Oura Membership. They sit next to your Apple Health data in the Lab and Deep Dive.\n• Already imported an Oura CSV? Synced days extend that history instead of starting a second copy.\n\nPRIVACY\n• Read-only: Correlate never changes anything in Oura and never writes Oura data to Apple Health. Your Oura data goes from Oura straight to your iPhone.\n• Disconnect any time, and choose whether to keep or delete the Oura data in Correlate.\n\nFIXED\n• Swiping to delete an imported series no longer closes the app.",
